{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"mdeet-2017-biology-10","exam":"MDEET","year":2017,"subject":"biology","number":10,"points":4,"unitId":"genetics","unitLabel":"유전학","topic":"대립유전자·표현형·교배","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["genetics"],"stem":"다음은어떤곤충의표피색깔에대한자료이다.\n◦표피색깔은검정색, 노란색, 회색색소에의해결정되며, 색소\n형성에유전자A와B가관여한다.\n◦A와B에는각각한쌍의대립유전자가있으며, 대립유전자\n사이에완전한우열관계가있다.\n◦A가암호화하는효소Ⅰ은색소㉠을색소㉡으로전환시킨다.\n◦B가암호화하는효소Ⅱ는색소㉠과㉡을색소㉢으로\n전환시킨다.\n◦A와B가모두이형접합인검정색곤충을자가교배하여얻은\n자손F1 1600 마리의표현형은다음과같다.\n표현형\n개체수(마리)\n검정색\n1200\n노란색\n300\n회색\n100\n이에대한설명으로옳은것만을<보기>에서있는대로고른것은?\n<보기>\nㄱ. ㉢은검정색이다.\nㄴ. 노란색F1에서효소Ⅱ가합성된다.\nㄷ. A와B에대해검정색F1이가질수있는대립유전자의\n조합은4 가지이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t025"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t026"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t027"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t028"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":["fig-03"],"textItemIds":["t029"]}],"answer":1,"acceptedAnswers":[1],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":776,"height":975,"region":0,"bbox":[14.355,29.948,310.4,390.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2017-biology-10/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":776,"height":236,"region":0,"bbox":[13.955,472.348,310.4,94.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t020","t021","t022","t023","t024"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2017-biology-10/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":811,"height":3,"region":0,"bbox":[-0.045,931.948,324.4,1.2],"role":"option","overlayTextItemIds":[],"optionNumber":5,"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2017-biology-10/03.webp"}],"layout